          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2022 A value with one or more blank spaces (ASCII char code 32)"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The data architect wants to conform the Company B data to the Company A standard, specifically regarding the use of an explicit $0 for journeys without revenue. Which script line should the data architect use?"
          }
